---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: vestingContractAddress[investor] != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_call_release: vestingContract.release(investor)
    q_call_release --> [*]: emit VestedTokensReleased event

    q_check_vesting --> q_revert: no vesting contract for investor
    q_revert --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract

    note right of q_call_release
        INV-001: release delegates to external vesting contract
        INV-002: vesting schedule enforced by vesting contract (not this contract)
        INV-003: can be called multiple times (releases available vested amount)
    end note
